# /etc/mosquitto/legacy-243.acl on home-pi
# Clients on 192.168.1.243 may use only these topics, whatever name they log in
# with (anonymous; the freezer monitor as home-pi; the graveyard Photon has
# also been seen as frontlights). "pattern" lines apply to every client;
# "topic" lines would only cover anonymous ones, and a named client with no
# entry is silently refused (that cost the graveyard its commands once).
pattern readwrite graveyard/#
pattern readwrite ghosts/#
pattern readwrite basement_freezer/#
pattern readwrite outTopic/#
